# hashlayer-labs git author

When committing or pushing in **`hashlayer-labs`**:

- Use **one of** the identities in `.githooks/allowed-authors` (random rotation is fine; anonymous emails OK).
- **Never** use `peijiaqi`, `peijiaq`, `1278017494@qq.com`, or `jiaqipei76@gmail.com`.
- After clone: `git config --local core.hooksPath .githooks`
- Pick an allowed author (or run `.githooks/pick-author.sh`) before commit.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` to commit messages.
- Mono sync workflow (`.github/workflows/sync-opensource.yml`) must use the same allowlist.
